---
import { method } from '../data/site';
const levels = ['Business outcomes', 'Workflow performance', 'The capacity and experience of the people doing the work'];
---

<section class="section section--tint method" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="method__head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The method</p>
        <h2 class="h2 method__title" id="method-title" data-reveal style="--i:1">
          Work <span class="arrow">→</span> Workflow <span class="arrow">→</span> Value
        </h2>
        <p class="lede method__lede" data-reveal style="--i:2">
          AI-assisted work is redesigned for value. I begin with the business priority and the work that creates
          it. The method connects three questions leaders need to answer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ol class="method__list" role="list">
      {method.map((m, i) => (
        <li class="method__row" data-reveal style={`--i:${i}`}>
          <span class="method__index">0{i + 1}</span>
          <h3 class="method__term">{m.term}</h3>
          <p class="method__q">{m.question}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <div class="grid method__value">
      <div class="method__value-text">
        <p class="body" data-reveal>
          Value is measured at three levels: business outcomes, workflow performance, and the capacity and
          experience of the people doing the work.
        </p>
        <p class="body" data-reveal style="--i:1">
          Better-designed work should strengthen employee trust, clarity, confidence, agency, and meaning. Aligned
          reward systems reinforce the new ways of working the organization wants to sustain.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ol class="levels" role="list" aria-label="Three levels of value">
        {levels.map((l, i) => (
          <li class="levels__item" data-reveal style={`--i:${i}`}>
            <span class="levels__bar" style={`--w:${100 - i * 18}%`}></span>
            <span class="levels__label">{l}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .method__head {
    grid-column: 1 / 10;
  }
  .method__title {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 84px);
  }
  .method__lede {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .method__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .method__row {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0, 4fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 32px);
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 44px) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .method__row::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: -1px;
    height: 1px;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--teal);
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left;
    transition: transform 0.8s var(--ease);
  }
  .method__row:hover::after {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }
  .method__index {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--teal);
  }
  .method__term {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .method__q {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 21px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .method__value {
    margin-top: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px);
    row-gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .method__value-text {
    grid-column: 1 / 7;
  }
  .method__value-text > * + * {
    margin-top: 1.1em;
  }
  .levels {
    grid-column: 8 / 13;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .levels__item + .levels__item {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  .levels__bar {
    display: block;
    height: 2px;
    width: var(--w);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--teal), rgba(14, 116, 144, 0.25));
  }
  .levels__label {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 699px) {
    .method__row {
      grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr;
    }
    .method__q {
      grid-column: 2;
    }
  }
</style>
